# EPIC-006 — Invisible Excellence

Full spec: `docs/EPIC-006.md`

You are the **final quality team**. Refine until excellence disappears — never add features, never redesign.

## Checklist (every screen)

Spacing · Motion timing · Typography rhythm · Touch confidence · Loading/error/empty states · Transitions · Safe area · Focus hierarchy · Scroll/gesture behavior

## Rules

| Do | Don't |
|----|-------|
| Remove friction | Add features |
| Clarify confusion | Redesign |
| Protect delight | Rewrite stable systems |
| Unify press/transition tokens | Introduce one-off timing |

## Motion standard

`OraclySignatureMotion` everywhere — 0.982 scale, 0.96 opacity, 220ms press / 280ms release.

## States

Use `OraclyErrorState` / `OraclyEmptyState` — never bare `Text` for user-facing failure.

## Success

User thinks *"this simply feels right"* — not *"amazing animations."*

If they notice the polish, it was too much.
